{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00289",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 4.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Morning, um, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.91,
      "end_seconds": 9.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.65,
      "end_seconds": 16.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a very sore throat, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.84,
      "end_seconds": 23.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "How long have you had it? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.48,
      "end_seconds": 29.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "For three days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.05,
      "end_seconds": 36.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.02,
      "end_seconds": 41.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Yes, swallowing. That makes it worse. It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.36,
      "end_seconds": 46.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Okay, what about swollen glands in the neck, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.09,
      "end_seconds": 50.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Yeah, um, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.82,
      "end_seconds": 58.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Have you had a very sore throat before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.73,
      "end_seconds": 65.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 70.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any difficulty breathing, rash or drooling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.93,
      "end_seconds": 74.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.47,
      "end_seconds": 77.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Have you had any ear pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.1,
      "end_seconds": 82.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any ear pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.8,
      "end_seconds": 89.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.86,
      "end_seconds": 105.34,
      "duration_seconds": 14.48,
      "text": "Seretide inhaler, twice a day. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. Okay, so I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.83,
      "end_seconds": 108.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.77,
      "end_seconds": 110.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "For about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.2,
      "end_seconds": 116.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.46,
      "end_seconds": 125.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "I've got asthma. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I've, I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.74,
      "end_seconds": 135.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Okay, asthma, that's already on your record. Good to know. Okay, heart disease, that's already on your record. Good to know. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.39,
      "end_seconds": 143.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Yes, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.55,
      "end_seconds": 151.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.31,
      "end_seconds": 153.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "My brother has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.15,
      "end_seconds": 157.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.66,
      "end_seconds": 159.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.22,
      "end_seconds": 174.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.27,
      "end_seconds": 179.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.88,
      "end_seconds": 182.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.4,
      "end_seconds": 186.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.28,
      "end_seconds": 190.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.98,
      "end_seconds": 201.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.53,
      "end_seconds": 219.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 120 over 80, temperature is 39.1 degrees, heart rate 107. And SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.4,
      "end_seconds": 221.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.44,
      "end_seconds": 225.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.77,
      "end_seconds": 230.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.8,
      "end_seconds": 234.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.03,
      "end_seconds": 246.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "The glands under the jaw are tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.35,
      "end_seconds": 249.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.57,
      "end_seconds": 269.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Both tonsils are red and swollen, and there are white patches on the left one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.76,
      "end_seconds": 274.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.3,
      "end_seconds": 297.14,
      "duration_seconds": 18.84,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is tonsillitis, probably bacterial. It could also be a viral throat infection, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.73,
      "end_seconds": 300.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.15,
      "end_seconds": 316.77,
      "duration_seconds": 14.62,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now tonsillitis, probably bacterial is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a very sore throat for three days, moderate, and no difficulty breathing or ear pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.94,
      "end_seconds": 319.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.67,
      "end_seconds": 323.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.16,
      "end_seconds": 329.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "No, you know, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.84,
      "end_seconds": 338.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "I'm going to order a throat swab, for sore throat. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.14,
      "end_seconds": 342.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.54,
      "end_seconds": 351.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "Let's use azithromycin, 500 milligrams, once a day, for three days. You take it by mouth. That should help with throat infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.11,
      "end_seconds": 353.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.97,
      "end_seconds": 382.71,
      "duration_seconds": 28.74,
      "text": "Gargle with warm salt water a few times a day, it does soothe it. Finish the whole course of antibiotics even if you feel better after two days. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you can't swallow your saliva or you have trouble breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.09,
      "end_seconds": 385.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.26,
      "end_seconds": 389.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Please come and see me in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.62,
      "end_seconds": 391.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.92,
      "end_seconds": 395.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.79,
      "end_seconds": 399.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.91,
      "end_seconds": 401.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}